; ELF dispatch in a lab (Team 6, 10 Nov 2026).
; The host script copies ElfTest, elf.library and these files to SYS:ElfDispatch
; and runs this through LabAgent. FailAt 21 so a refusal does not stop the rest.
; A PowerPC file is the AC460 route. An x86-64 file and an AArch64 file are
; refused with their sentences. A Hunk file is 68k and runs as one.
FailAt 21
Echo "--- ppc ---"
C:ElfTest DOS SYS:ElfDispatch/ppc-exec
Echo "--- x86-64 ---"
C:ElfTest DOS SYS:ElfDispatch/x86_64-object
Echo "--- aarch64 ---"
C:ElfTest DOS SYS:ElfDispatch/aarch64-object
Echo "--- hunk ---"
SYS:ElfDispatch/hunk-hello
Echo "--- done ---"
